1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
If you play GTA 6 like GTA 5... you're getting busted.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,000
Ten things you need to know.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,600
Two heroes. Jason and Lucia work as a team, and splitting up can shake the cops.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:15,800
No witness, no crime. Police only come if someone sees you or an alarm goes off.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:21,400
Cops remember you. Your face, your outfit, your car. Change all three to disappear.

6
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:26,600
Crime scenes stay hot. Go back too soon and the stars come right back.

7
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:31,800
Six stars are back. And at max heat, Leonida stops playing fair.

8
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:37,600
You can't carry an arsenal. Two handguns, two long guns. The rest stays in the trunk.

9
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:43,200
Cash on you is at risk. Die or get busted and you lose it. Bank it at an ATM.

10
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:49,600
Vice City is just the start. Leonida has the Keys, Grassrivers, Port Gellhorn, Ambrosia and Mount Kalaga.

11
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:55,200
Online isn't here yet. GTA Online for 6 is expected in 2027, and PC is coming later.

12
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:03,400
And the craziest part? GTA 6 made three point seven nine billion dollars on day one. The biggest entertainment launch in history.

13
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:09,000
Jason or Lucia, who are you playing first? Send this to the friend who's still downloading.

